<#-- The comparison of an RFQ's quotes (mantle.order.SourcingServices.compare#SupplierQuotes with output print), for the
     buyer's file: the basis (revision, display currency and rate date), then each demand line with its offers, each with the
     original basis (the supplier's quantity, unit, price and currency) and the normalized one (price per demand unit in the
     display currency, committed amount, freight and estimated landed cost), lead time, validity and risk. An offer that
     cannot be compared says why; it is never shown as zero or ranked. requestId, requestName, organizationName, revisionText,
     basisText and demands (productText, quantityText, uomText, requiredText, remainingText, offers: rankText, supplierName,
     statusText, originalText, basisText, normalizedText, committedText, freightText, landedText, leadText, validityText,
     riskText, reasonText). -->
<!doctype html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>${ec.l10n.localize('Quote comparison')} ${requestId}</title>
<style>
@page { size: A4 landscape; margin: 14mm; }
body { font: 9pt Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #20252b; }
h1 { font-size: 16pt; margin: 0 0 2mm; }
h2 { font-size: 11pt; margin: 6mm 0 2mm; }
.sub { color: #59606b; margin: 0 0 4mm; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
td, th { padding: 3px 5px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
thead { display: table-header-group; }
tbody tr { break-inside: avoid; }
th { border-bottom: 1px solid #20252b; }
td { border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
.amount { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
.note { color: #59606b; font-size: 8pt; }
</style></head>
<body>
<h1>${ec.l10n.localize('Quote comparison')} ${requestId}</h1>
<p class="sub">${requestName} · ${organizationName} · ${revisionText}<br>${basisText}</p>
<#list demands as demand>
<h2>${demand.productText} · ${demand.quantityText} ${demand.uomText}<#if demand.requiredText> · ${ec.l10n.localize('required by')} ${demand.requiredText}</#if><#if demand.remainingText> · ${ec.l10n.localize('left to award')} ${demand.remainingText}</#if></h2>
<table>
    <thead><tr>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Rank')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Supplier')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('As quoted')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Basis')}</th>
        <th class="amount">${ec.l10n.localize('Unit price')}</th>
        <th class="amount">${ec.l10n.localize('Committed')}</th>
        <th class="amount">${ec.l10n.localize('Freight')}</th>
        <th class="amount">${ec.l10n.localize('Est. landed')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Lead time')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Valid')}</th>
        <th>${ec.l10n.localize('Risk')}</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    <#list demand.offers as offer>
        <tr>
            <td>${offer.rankText}</td>
            <td>${offer.supplierName}<br><span class="note">${offer.statusText}</span></td>
            <td>${offer.originalText}</td>
            <td>${offer.basisText}<#if offer.reasonText><br><span class="note">${offer.reasonText}</span></#if></td>
            <td class="amount">${offer.normalizedText}</td>
            <td class="amount">${offer.committedText}</td>
            <td class="amount">${offer.freightText}</td>
            <td class="amount">${offer.landedText}</td>
            <td>${offer.leadText}</td>
            <td>${offer.validityText}</td>
            <td>${offer.riskText}</td>
        </tr>
    </#list>
    </tbody>
</table>
</#list>
<p class="note" style="margin-top:6mm">${ec.l10n.localize('The ranking compares committed unit prices; it does not choose or approve a supplier. Estimated landed cost adds the quoted freight, where given.')}</p>
</body></html>
